  <article class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <a class="back" href="/">← Back home</a>

      <p><strong>IMPORTANT: PLEASE READ THESE TERMS CAREFULLY BEFORE SUBSCRIBING TO RHO NAVIGATOR.</strong></p>

      <p>By purchasing a subscription, accessing our TradingView indicators, joining our Telegram groups, or participating in our webinars, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and Risk Disclaimer.</p>

