      <h2 id="s1">1. Service Description</h2>
      <p>RHO Navigator provides:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>TradingView Indicators:</strong> Dynamic trend channels, support/resistance identification, and automated TP/SL recommendations</li>
        <li><strong>Telegram Signal Groups:</strong> Real-time trading signals for selected large-cap stocks across Hong Kong, Singapore, US markets, and Global Assets (Forex, Crypto, Commodities)</li>
        <li><strong>Educational Webinars:</strong> Weekly live training sessions on market analysis, indicator usage, and trading strategies</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="s2">2. Educational Purpose — Not Financial Advice</h2>
      <p><strong>ALL CONTENT PROVIDED BY RHO NAVIGATOR IS FOR EDUCATIONAL AND INFORMATIONAL PURPOSES ONLY.</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Nothing provided through our indicators, signals, webinars, or communications constitutes financial advice, investment advice, trading advice, or any recommendation to buy, sell, or hold any security or financial instrument</li>
