        <li>Conducting your own due diligence and research before executing any trades</li>
        <li>Understanding the risks associated with each financial instrument you trade</li>
        <li>Managing your own risk through appropriate position sizing and stop-loss orders</li>
        <li>Complying with all applicable laws and regulations in your jurisdiction</li>
        <li>Determining the tax implications of your trading activities</li>
        <li>Ensuring you have the financial capacity to sustain losses</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="s5">5. No Guarantees or Warranties</h2>
      <p><strong>WE EXPLICITLY DISCLAIM ALL GUARANTEES:</strong></p>
