        <li><strong>No Performance Guarantee:</strong> Past performance of our signals or indicators does not guarantee future performance</li>
        <li><strong>No Results Guarantee:</strong> Your results may vary significantly from any examples, testimonials, or performance statistics we provide</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="s6">6. Subscription Terms</h2>

      <h3>6.1 Billing &amp; Payment</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Subscription Period:</strong> All subscriptions are billed on a 3-month basis</li>
        <li><strong>Payment Processing:</strong> All payments are processed securely through Stripe</li>
        <li><strong>Automatic Renewal:</strong> Subscriptions automatically renew every 3 months unless cancelled</li>
        <li><strong>Price Changes:</strong> We reserve the right to change subscription prices with 30 days' notice to existing subscribers</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>6.2 Cancellation &amp; Refunds</h3>
