        <li><strong>No Partial Refunds:</strong> We do not provide partial refunds for unused portions of your subscription</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>6.3 Account Terms</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Personal Use Only:</strong> Your subscription is for your personal use only and may not be shared, resold, or transferred</li>
        <li><strong>Telegram Username Required:</strong> You must have a Telegram username set to access our signal groups</li>
