      <p>Webinars typically cover:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Macro trend analysis on major indices</li>
        <li>Performance review of specific instruments for the week</li>
        <li>Training on proper indicator usage</li>
        <li>Identification of upcoming trading opportunities</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>7.3 Key Person Risk</h3>
      <div class="tw">
        <strong>⚠️ IMPORTANT: KEY PERSON RISK</strong>
        <p>All webinars are conducted by a single trading expert. In the event of illness, personal emergency, or unforeseen circumstances, webinars may be postponed or cancelled with reasonable notice. We will make every effort to reschedule cancelled webinars when possible, but we do not guarantee make-up sessions. No refunds or credits will be provided for postponed or cancelled webinars.</p>
      </div>

      <h3>7.4 Webinar Access</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Webinar links will be shared via Telegram groups or email</li>
        <li>Recordings may or may not be provided at our discretion</li>
