      </ul>

      <h2 id="s11">11. Privacy &amp; Data Collection</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We collect your email, Telegram username, and payment information to provide services</li>
        <li>Payment information is processed securely by Stripe; we do not store credit card details</li>
        <li>We may use your information to send service-related communications</li>
